{"name":"Snowbelt","hex":"#eef1ec","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"snowbelt","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An area that is characterized by heavy annual snowfall.","Especially, the area around the Great Lakes in the north-eastern United States."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/snowbelt"}],"entries":[{"title":"Snowbelt","blocks":[{"text":"The Snowbelt, Snow Belt, Frostbelt, or Frost Belt is the region near the Great Lakes in North America where heavy snowfall in the form of lake-effect snow is particularly common. Snowbelts are typically found downwind of the lakes, principally off the eastern and southern shores."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Great_Lakes_Snowbelt_EPA_fr.png/330px-Great_Lakes_Snowbelt_EPA_fr.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Snowbelt"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/Lake_Effect_snow_on_January_10_2022.jpg/500px-Lake_Effect_snow_on_January_10_2022.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/Lake_Effect_snow_on_January_10_2022.jpg/1280px-Lake_Effect_snow_on_January_10_2022.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/Lake_Effect_snow_on_January_10_2022.jpg/500px-Lake_Effect_snow_on_January_10_2022.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Lake-effect snow is the cause of the regional nickname.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALake_Effect_snow_on_January_10_2022.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Snow-removal-cleveland-3.jpg/330px-Snow-removal-cleveland-3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia